          "insert": "StyleRail.tsx",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " owns the settings type, compiled defaults, tolerant local-storage reader, normalization, variable conversion, and root application; rail settings never gain a second reader or writer module."
